#: 9e775913d6c64c3f918b85d41991ed3e eb3573b0ff9f4d54977e7ea83faf6136
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides the ability to notify users visually and/or aurally, of "
"important status information and warnings. These can be provided on-board or"
" externally via several types of devices: :ref:`single color LEDs, RGB LEDS,"
" OLED displays<common-external-leds>`, and :ref:`Buzzers<common-buzzer>`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供视觉和/或声音方式，向用户通知重要状态信息和警告。这些通知可通过多种类型的设备在机上或外部提供：:ref:`单色 LED、RGB"
" LED、OLED 显示屏<common-external-leds>` 和 :ref:`蜂鸣器<common-buzzer>`。"

