msgid ""
"The brightness of the LEDs can be controlled via the "
":ref:`NTF_LED_BRIGHT<NTF_LED_BRIGHT>` parameter."
msgstr "LED 的亮度可通过 :ref:`NTF_LED_BRIGHT<NTF_LED_BRIGHT>` 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:48
#: 45d1538bb1d845ebb363047a2fd8c0df 7c8abd8e9d1f4810a704c57ea171a3ee
#: 81de22ac2c324d39845ccc57a9919f8b c5a4f1e4247348f1ab95789bc2e3a67b
#: db521af741094ef292dd7ed15eb9ec6a
msgid "OLED Displays"
msgstr "OLED 显示屏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:50
#: 0eb2661695524d6db124e942ecf27095 30008a4e978749879d1f10a8c37f3ffa
#: bd1ed9786a1c48b8b6dc945b227335fc cd17e91e2fd04f52859afbfd8f4349f1
#: fd23308628e249a7a87a6a19fa9ca2c6
msgid ""
"In addition, two I2C connected OLED Displays are supported which display key"
" autopilot status and status text messages: SSH1106 and SSD1306 compatible "
"displays. These will display the text messages normally sent to a Ground "
"Control Station, as well as some status information."
msgstr ""
"此外，还支持两种 I2C 连接的 OLED 显示屏，可显示关键飞控状态和状态文本消息：SSH1106 和 SSD1306 "
"兼容显示屏。它们将显示通常发送到地面控制站的文本消息以及一些状态信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:55
#: 0599df9c64da480b92f16f54b757e6ed 53c62c2a758c4b3bb5f4332e1d069ee5
#: b3a1b2d71b9b443e8380179e327f400f dd492bb2153143398268a5e45657ad14
#: f125d83b28db4eaa9e7471c4fca6a99a
msgid ""
"These are enabled via the :ref:`NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE<NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE>` "
"parameter."
msgstr "通过 :ref:`NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE<NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE>` 参数启用这些显示屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:58
